# This skill pack documents third-party CLIs. It does not read its own secrets.
# Each CLI uses that product's normal login path (subscription, keyring, or API key).
# Do not put live tokens in this repository.
#
# Optional local overrides for operators, not consumed by this repo:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=replace-with-your-real-key
# OPENAI_API_KEY=replace-with-your-real-key
# XAI_API_KEY=replace-with-your-real-key
